Our staging API gateway started rejecting 100% of newly logged-in users at 04:00 UTC while older sessions still worked for 15 minutes.

[Artifact 1: IdP Audit Log (`idp.staging.corp.example`)]
```
2026-11-22T04:00:01Z INFO key_manager rotated active signing key old_kid="rs-2026-10" new_kid="rs-2026-11" jwks_published=true
```

[Artifact 2: Go Gateway Verifier (`internal/auth/jwks.go`)]
```go
func (v *Verifier) getKey(kid string) (*rsa.PublicKey, error) {
    if time.Since(v.fetchedAt) > time.Hour {
        if err := v.refreshJWKS(); err != nil {
            return nil, err
        }
    }
    key, ok := v.keys[kid]
    if !ok {
        return nil, fmt.Errorf("unknown kid: %s", kid)
