`header_buf.c`:
```c
char *buf = malloc(128);
size_t cap = 128, len = 0;
char *hdr_val = buf + colon_offset + 2; // saved pointer to header value start

if (len + chunk_len >= cap) {
    cap *= 2;
    buf = realloc(buf, cap);
