```

[Artifact 2: Fuzz Inputs (`crash-1` and `timeout-2`)]
```
crash-1 (13 bytes):   [12-byte DNS header] + [0xC0]              -> offset=12 < 13, reads pkt[13] OOB!
timeout-2 (14 bytes): [12-byte DNS header] + [0xC0, 0x0C]        -> offset=12 jumps to target=12 forever!
```

[Artifact 3: RFC 1035 Name Compression Invariants]
```
1. A compression pointer occupies 2 bytes (`offset + 1 < pkt_len`) and MUST point strictly BACKWARD (`target < current_offset`) to avoid cycles!
2. Total decompressed domain length MUST NOT exceed 255 bytes!
```

